dstat (0.8.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release from the maintained fork.
  * Fix Python 3 OverflowError when network interface counters regress
    (for example when a veth interface is removed with its container).
  * Use python3 in the shebang and drop the six dependency.

